{"id":"c2d70d09f89c8624","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote.md","title":"PolyDenote","display":"PolyDenote","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyDenote","parameters":["D","ap","k","s","d","rho","g","t","a","e","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyDenote"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>ap</span><span>k</span><span>s</span><span>d</span><span>rho</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span><span>e</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>ap</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>d</code>、<code>rho</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>条件于明确的集合大小 SK 代数；一般可靠性需要 PER 基本引理，编译器不证明该引理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyDenote D ap k s d rho g t a e v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ CombAlgebra D ap k s)\n  (and\n    (@ PolyType d g t a)\n    (and\n      (@ PolyTermEnv D ap d rho g e)\n      (exists u (exists c (and (@ PolyErase t u) (and (@ CombCompile u c) (@ CombEval D ap k s e c v))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bef032c6dfb2940e\" href=\"?note=bef032c6dfb2940e\" title=\"ZFC_CombAlgebra\">CombAlgebra</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5cd32a06fd4a9374\" href=\"?note=5cd32a06fd4a9374\" title=\"ZFC_CombCompile\">CombCompile</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25f8fb4dddc2a4b4\" href=\"?note=25f8fb4dddc2a4b4\" title=\"ZFC_CombEval\">CombEval</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"688e0ea28a1311cc\" href=\"?note=688e0ea28a1311cc\" title=\"ZFC_PolyErase\">PolyErase</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e734c6827b2426f\" href=\"?note=0e734c6827b2426f\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTermEnv\">PolyTermEnv</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" href=\"?note=de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" title=\"ZFC_PolyType\">PolyType</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyDenote D ap k s d rho g t a e v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CombAlgebra","status":"resolved","id":"bef032c6dfb2940e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CombCompile","status":"resolved","id":"5cd32a06fd4a9374","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CombEval","status":"resolved","id":"25f8fb4dddc2a4b4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyErase","status":"resolved","id":"688e0ea28a1311cc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTermEnv","status":"resolved","id":"0e734c6827b2426f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyType","status":"resolved","id":"de2d60bf72fd6cc5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CombAlgebra|CombAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_CombCompile|CombCompile]]；[[ZFC_CombEval|CombEval]]；[[ZFC_PolyErase|PolyErase]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermEnv|PolyTermEnv]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1288,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6df37cab7bc6f11","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote|PolyDenote]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-596","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote|PolyDenote]]"},{"id":"feb5357ce56a8ac2","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyDenote|PolyDenote]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","bef032c6dfb2940e","5cd32a06fd4a9374","25f8fb4dddc2a4b4","688e0ea28a1311cc","0e734c6827b2426f","de2d